stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> Pending : placeOrder() / order created
  Pending --> Preparing : 10 s elapsed OR manager "Mark Preparing"
  Preparing --> Ready : 20 s elapsed OR manager "Mark Ready"
  Ready --> Served : 30 s elapsed OR manager "Mark Served"
  Pending --> Cancelled : manager "Cancel"
  Preparing --> Cancelled : manager "Cancel"
  Served --> [*]
  Cancelled --> [*]
  note right of Pending
    Timers stop once a manager
    changes status manually
    (manualOverride = true)
  end note
